# Studio lock files
/*.rbxlx.lock
/*.rbxl.lock

# Generated static-analysis inputs (recreated by scripts/check.sh)
/sourcemap.json
/globalTypes.d.luau

# The Studio place, in either format. The demo builds every part in code, so the place is a
# stock Baseplate carrying nothing -- and Studio rewrites the binary on every save, which
# would churn the history with blobs that cannot be diffed or merged.
# Track it instead if you ever hand-build world geometry that the code does not create.
/*.rbxl
/*.rbxlx

/.claude/settings.local.json
